    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.755,
      "text": "Want to join Atomy but don't know a sponsor? You are not out of options.",
      "shot": "A registration ticket arrives with a blank SPONSOR box and oversized question mark. Per-word reveal (dynamic-content-sequencing), cream ground, title NO SPONSOR? upper third, tilted ticket center and faint dot grid behind."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.855,
      "end": 10.489,
      "text": "The official U S guide says a sponsor is necessary, but describes automatic or manual sponsor selection.",
      "shot": "The blank box unfolds into a vertical fork: AUTOMATIC and MANUAL. SVG paths draw (svg-path-draw) on the choices' spoken cues, then tiles arrive. Label SPONSOR REQUIRED remains visible; make this an explanatory diagram, not a replica signup UI."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.589,
      "end": 17.501,
      "text": "Both consumer and distributor signup include that step. The guide also says placement is assigned automatically.",
      "shot": "Fork reconnects into CONSUMER and DISTRIBUTOR tickets, then a separate PLACEMENT AUTO lane draws beneath. Progressive disclosure (dynamic-content-sequencing), stacked diagram with distinct selection versus placement labels; no invented placement control."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.601,
      "end": 24.044,
      "text": "So check the official flow, not random promises in comments. Save this, and choose with the rules in view.",
      "shot": "Diagram contracts into a shielded OFFICIAL GUIDE ticket; random comment bubbles shrink away using scale-swap-transition. Inverted closer says CHECK THE OFFICIAL FLOW; SAVE arrives on cue and holds. Caption keepout maintained."
    }
  ],
